  homeLiking:
    resident: {fileID: 11400000}
    likes: Water close
    line: '"Water near, for the beds and the flax."'
    thanks: '"Water by the beds. The barley drinks, and I don''t carry it as far."'
  jobs:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 42d876bf3cb45f84088e94fc709b0672, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: cdd8fcb3acc60ec45854efd2eb13a408, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: d2fe6c057eeb1eb49928e1c363256205, type: 2}
  questLine:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 22c52c196cd7f01478e77e31ccc726a4, type: 2}
    text: You gather what the woods drop. I grow what they won't. Give me the Farmer's work and a plot of turned earth, and it grows while you're away.
    acceptText: A plot.
    waitingText: A Farm Plot. Turn the earth somewhere it gets the sun.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b82ec5eb9e9b7df43872b74101d604da, type: 2}
    text: Iron chafes. It wants linen under it. Build me a tailor's shop by Gunnar's lodge and I'll weave it, four bolts to start.
    acceptText: Linen, then.
    waitingText: The Tailor's Shop at Tier II, four Linen, and the Weaver's work for me.
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  questLineDone: 
  sideQuests:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 53e34a73f89dac640ab91738fbc66874, type: 2}
    text: 'I was found guarding seed at a burnt farm in the deep woods. There''s another in the Hollow Pines, my grandmother said: burnt the night the hearth went out, and somebody kept a fire going there after the roof was gone. I want to know what for.'
    acceptText: I'll go and see.
    waitingText: South, in the Hollow Pines. A longhouse with no roof. Look at their hearth.
    askText: The farm in the Hollow Pines?
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c02abb0f34687e841b484a01d52b7be5, type: 2}
    text: 
    acceptText: I'll do it.
    waitingText: 'They meant to come back. Follow the burnt fence and see how far they got. Take planks: whatever they left will be falling down.'
    askText: 
    thanksText: 
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7fd51412ce7494e4394efdf6c6ebd5a6, type: 2}
    text: 
    acceptText: I'll do it.
    waitingText: Light the Hollow Pines' stone, and I'll sow their seed where they meant to.
    askText: 
    thanksText: It came up. Their seed, in their field. I'll keep it for them.
